  "stories": [
    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "beacon-v1.3.5-transactional-multi-sink-consistency-and-llm-requirement-compiler",
      "priority": "medium",
      "status": "accepted",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "事务一致性：构造单 sink 失败场景时，不允许静默部分成功；必须阻断 freeze/release 并留下失败事务记录。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T150929Z-e370",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T15:16:09.283531+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "跨面一致性：同一提交后，human/machine/sqlite 的 `transaction_id/source_hash/projection_seq` 一致；否则标记 `drift`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T150929Z-e370",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T15:16:09.283531+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "PRD 编译质量：`prd create --mode llm` 输出必须覆盖边界、分层、恢复策略、验收链与风险缓解，不得退化为占位模板。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T150929Z-e370",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T15:16:09.283531+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "可审计降级：LLM 不可用或 contract 校验失败时，`mode=auto` 可降级 `rule`，且 machine 面保留 `fallback_reason` 与编译证据。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T150929Z-e370",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T15:16:09.283531+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "主链闭环不变形：不新增公开一级主命令；`implement single/team/ralph` 在同一 requirement truth 下执行与验收。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T150929Z-e370",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T15:16:09.283531+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
